{
  "id": "E261",
  "title": "Can You Eat Spicy Food?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2018-10-04",
  "synopsis": "If you like spicy food, you should try Sichuan cuisine.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/856/38fd49493cc6b700bca55ef4ff32833c43a3d6d2.mp3?1538286225",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你会吃辣吗\n\n本：丽丽，晚饭你想吃什么？\n丽丽：还没想好。\n本：你会吃辣吗？\n丽丽：会，我很喜欢吃辣。\n本：那我们去学校外面的川菜馆吧。\n丽丽：好啊，走吧！",
    "traditional": "你會吃辣嗎\n\n本：麗麗，晚飯你想吃什麼？\n麗麗：還沒想好。\n本：你會吃辣嗎？\n麗麗：會，我很喜歡吃辣。\n本：那我們去學校外面的川菜館吧。\n麗麗：好啊，走吧！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Can you eat spicy food?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：丽丽，晚饭你想吃什么？",
      "traditional": "本：麗麗，晚飯你想吃什麼？",
      "pinyin": "běn lì lì wǎn fàn nǐ xiǎng chī shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili, what do you want to have for dinner?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：还没想好。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：還沒想好。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hái méi xiǎng hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I haven’t decided yet."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：你会吃辣吗？",
      "traditional": "本：你會吃辣嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ huì chī là ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Can you eat spicy food?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：会，我很喜欢吃辣。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：會，我很喜歡吃辣。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì huì wǒ hěn xǐ huan chī là",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Yes, I like spicy food a lot."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：那我们去学校外面的川菜馆吧。",
      "traditional": "本：那我們去學校外面的川菜館吧。",
      "pinyin": "běn nà wǒ men qù xué xiào wài miàn de chuān cài guǎn ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Then let’s go to the Sichuan restaurant outside the campus."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽：好啊，走吧！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：好啊，走吧！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hǎo a zǒu ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Ok, let’s go."
    }
  ],
